+`units.js` 1.0.1, `header.js` 1.0.1, `siteHeader.js` 1.0.1,
+`charts-d3.html` 1.0.1, `climate.html` 1.0.1, `gauges.html` 1.0.1,
+`divumwf.js` 1.0.1, `modalMetar.html` 1.0.1,
